# Students bucket

Per-student tasks only. Shared sheets live in `projects/docs/`, shared builds in `projects/`, curricula in `tracks/`. Link to them, do not copy them here.

## Layout (fixed)

```text
students/<student>/<subject>/<NN-slug>/
  README.md     topics explained simply
  TASK.md       original task + simple version + tests
  starter/      student works here (skeleton + TODOs, never solved)
  solution/     complete reference solution + walkthrough
```

- Create tasks only with `/new-task` or `node students/scripts/new-task.mjs` so index pages stay in sync.
- Templates: `students/_template/`. Change the template, not every task, when the format changes.
- `starter/` must never contain the answer. `solution/` is the only place for it.

## Writing style

- Explain like for a 6-year-old: short sentences, one idea per paragraph, real-life picture first, code second.
- Keep the original task text unchanged in `TASK.md`; translate hard words in a "Words to know" table.
- Solutions use only what the task teaches. No clever tricks a beginner has not seen.
